WEBVTT

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.400
(HORNS BLARE)

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.200
Who the heck is that? A kid?

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.720
Oh!
(STONE CLATTERS)

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:16.920
(CLEARS THROAT)
Guys!

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.960
Hello! Mini-Boss!

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.800
What are you doing here?

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.320
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.240
OK, just get on!

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.280
(SMASH) Which way did he go?
There's that little thief!

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.000
Go, go, go!
(BANG)

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.480
Split up!

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:33.240
(FAST-PACED ACTION MUSIC)

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.720
(WHIMPERS)
Whoa!

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.920
(GRUNTS)

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:43.280
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:47.040
Knock, knock! Delivery!

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.160
Wha...

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.800
(CHUCKLES)
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.720
(SCREAMS)

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.080
(WHIMPERS) (SIGHS)

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.680
(THUD)
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:00.680
That demon child!
(JEAN-CLAWED GROWLS)

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.560
Otto, take the stone
back to the lair!

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.920
I'll distract them! Go! Go, go, go!

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.200
(NUN-CHUCK SCREAMS)

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:09.840
(WHIMPERS)

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:16.640
Oh, not now. Come on, come on!

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.040
(GASPS)
(EFFORT GROWLS)

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:21.920
Oh!

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.240
(WHOOSHING)
Ha-ya!

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:24.640
(EFFORT GRUNTS)

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.240
(SLOW MOTION SCREAMS)

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:32.440
(THUD)

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:33.800
(CRASH)

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:36.720
(BRAKES SCREECH)
Yeah, baby.

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.840
I'll handle this!
(EFFORT GRUNTS)

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:42.960
(WHIMPERS)

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.840
(LAUGHS)
Ow!

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.960
Hope you enjoy
the rest of your short life.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.000
(PANTING)
Please work!

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.960
Come on, come on, come on!

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.640
Yay!

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:09.360
We're coming for you, tiny man!
(CRASH)

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.560
Yeah!
(CHEERING AND HOOTING)

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:18.200
(CHEERING)
Josh, pump it up!

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:19.720
Up, up, up!

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:22.400
(MUSIC PLAYS)
(CHEERING)

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:28.160
They all said
the kid couldn't be a real villain.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:32.160
Well, this kid just stole something

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.600
from the worst villains
in the world!

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.360
(CHEERING)

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:41.240
When I bring it back to them,
they are going to say... (GASPS)

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:46.800
"We have made a terrible mistake.
Please join us. Please, Gru."

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:49.320
And I will say, "Yes!

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:53.280
"I will be the newest member
of the Vicious Six!"

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.320
Now all I need is Otto.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.920
Where is Otto?
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:02.520
No, not "Otto le komay."
He needs to "komay" now.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.040
(SCREAMS) (GIGGLES)

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.200
(THUDS) (GIGGLES)

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.840
Otto!
Mini-Boss!

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.720
There you are.

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.440
(LAUGHS)
Ah. You got it?

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:15.600
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.240
Is this... Are you
pulling on my legs right now?

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.200
Otto, where is the stone?

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:24.920
The stone? Ah, see. The stone.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.840
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.240
Argh!
(SQUELCH)

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.200
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.400
(GASPS) (SCREAMS)

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.840
(SQUELCHING)

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:46.200
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (SCREAMS)

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.440
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.960
(DUCK SQUAWKS)
(SCREAMS)

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.160
(THUD)
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:59.000
(DUCK QUACKS)

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.320
(CHEERING)

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.120
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.360
(EXHALES SLOWLY)

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.000
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.960
Mi amore. Mi amore!

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.400
(ROMANTIC MUSIC)

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:18.800
SLOWLY: I love you.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.840
(MUFFLED MINIONESE)

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.200
(CHEERS)
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.320
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.360
(KISSES)

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:31.840
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.000
Hmph.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:39.760
Did you just trade my future
for a PET ROCK?!

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.000
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)
Si?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:46.000
Ugh. OK. Otto,
where was this birthday party?

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:50.000
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.800
This is unacceptable! Unacceptable!

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:56.480
I told you guys that you weren't
ready for the big leagues,

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.640
and you have proven me correct!

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.160
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.120
All you do is mess everything up.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:05.160
Up? Pump it up!
(LAUGHS)

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.640
# KC & THE SUNSHINE BAND:
Get Down Tonight #

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.280
What?
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.920
(RECORD SCRATCHES)
(GRUNTS)

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:15.040
My mom was right.
You do not belong here.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.840
You're fired!
(OVERLAPPING GASPS)

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.160
I'm going to find that stone.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:23.720
When I get home,
you all better be gone!

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.560
M-Mini-Boss.
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:28.560
And, Otto, CLOSE YOUR YAPPER!
Oh.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:33.200
Josh.
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:36.680
# THE CARPENTERS: Goodbye To Love #

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:44.000
Uh, Gru...
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:49.440
Kevin, no.
I will be better off on my own.

